{
  "schema": 1,
  "comment": "Actor-pair capsule sizes and push/support tuning. Profiles are keyed by the existing actor preset id; an unknown/empty preset uses 'default'. Units are metres, metres/second, and seconds. Reload is validated as a whole and applied at the next fixed tick; an invalid save keeps the last valid values.",
  "comment_push": "knockback_speed = max(weak_hit_distance_m / weak_hit_motion_seconds, max_knockback_speed_mps * pow(u, impact_speed_curve_exponent)) * angle_scale, where u = clamp((impact_speed - min_impact_speed_mps) / (max_impact_speed_mps - min_impact_speed_mps), 0, 1) and angle_scale interpolates by contact directness. The result enters the shared external-impulse path; collision position correction is depenetration only.",
  "broadphase": {
    "cell_size_m": 4.0,
    "max_candidate_pairs": 8192
  },
